{"3882920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Planet Ski", "steam_appid": 3882920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882920/extras/ef454ea8d1d419cdc5fe4994c7638c8a.avif?t=1776456018\" width=800 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planet Ski™ - Build the ski resort of your dreams!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve your dream winter paradise - from untouched alpine wilderness to massive international resorts. Design sweeping slopes, build bustling lodges, and choose from a wide variety of unique lifts and gondolas from all around the world! - <strong>Planet Ski™</strong> puts the powder in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please note: <strong>Planet Ski™</strong> is still in early development and not all features have yet been added to the game. Screenshots and content will be updated as the game grows...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏔️ - Lay out trails, design the terrain of your resort, and sculpt the perfect mountain for your visitors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚡 - Choose from a wide variety of lifts and gondolas to keep your guests moving, providing fast and efficient up-mountain transportation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎿 – Cater to beginners and pros alike with a variety of slopes, ski schools, dining venues, and luxury accommodations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠️ – Balance budgets, staff, maintenance, and guest happiness to grow your resort into a global destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 – Import maps of real resorts, battle the dynamic weather, and design your resort’s look down to the last detail. <strong>Planet Ski™</strong> offers you unlimited opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Directed by <strong>Bamsen</strong> &amp; <strong>krokkob</strong>, <strong>Planet Ski™</strong> aims to fill the abandoned niche in the online skiing community and to help realize the many dreams of winter enthusiasts. Being closely knit to its player-base, modding and community interaction are an integral part of our game and project. Although Planet Ski™ is still in early development, we are happy to hear your feedback and suggestions.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882920/extras/ef454ea8d1d419cdc5fe4994c7638c8a.avif?t=1776456018\" width=800 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planet Ski™ - Build the ski resort of your dreams!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve your dream winter paradise - from untouched alpine wilderness to massive international resorts. Design sweeping slopes, build bustling lodges, and choose from a wide variety of unique lifts and gondolas from all around the world! - <strong>Planet Ski™</strong> puts the powder in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please note: <strong>Planet Ski™</strong> is still in early development and not all features have yet been added to the game. Screenshots and content will be updated as the game grows...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏔️ - Lay out trails, design the terrain of your resort, and sculpt the perfect mountain for your visitors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚡 - Choose from a wide variety of lifts and gondolas to keep your guests moving, providing fast and efficient up-mountain transportation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎿 – Cater to beginners and pros alike with a variety of slopes, ski schools, dining venues, and luxury accommodations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠️ – Balance budgets, staff, maintenance, and guest happiness to grow your resort into a global destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 – Import maps of real resorts, battle the dynamic weather, and design your resort’s look down to the last detail. <strong>Planet Ski™</strong> offers you unlimited opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Directed by <strong>Bamsen</strong> &amp; <strong>krokkob</strong>, <strong>Planet Ski™</strong> aims to fill the abandoned niche in the online skiing community and to help realize the many dreams of winter enthusiasts. Being closely knit to its player-base, modding and community interaction are an integral part of our game and project. Although Planet Ski™ is still in early development, we are happy to hear your feedback and suggestions.</p>", "short_description": "Carve your dream winter paradise - from untouched alpine wilderness to massive international resorts. Design sweeping slopes, build bustling lodges, and choose from a wide variety of unique lifts and gondolas from all around the world! - Planet Ski™ puts the powder in your hands.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882920/bdf707b2ed5383fea5761d92f9ed7f7659cc9d2f/header.jpg?t=1776456018", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882920/9f702e5cc85ec3085c945430383fb0c448bcbf22/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776456018", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882920/9f702e5cc85ec3085c945430383fb0c448bcbf22/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776456018", "website": "https://playplanetski.org/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TB